 &lt;p&gt;本文由原作者归档自 CSDN，原文发布于 2022-01-19。原文链接：&lt;a href="https://blog.csdn.net/LIUHUAN0520/article/details/122576280" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;MaxScale不支持MySQL8.0的问题&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>mysql limit offset 原理分析与使用</title><link>/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Mar 2021 13:14:07 +0800</pubDate><author>code4happy@gmail.com (happy-v587)</author><guid>/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;本文由原作者归档自 CSDN，原文发布于 2021-03-16。原文链接：&lt;a href="https://blog.csdn.net/LIUHUAN0520/article/details/114869738" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;mysql limit offset 原理分析与使用&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id="背景" class="headerLink"&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="header-mark"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;背景&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;一个行数为4亿条的表。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="tw-inline" loading="lazy" src='/images/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong.md/img-01.png' alt="图 1" &gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;查询50000000~50000010行之间的数据。发现查询时间达到20s！！！&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>mysql异步复制、半同步复制、组复制</title><link>/mysql-yi-bu-fu-zhi-ban-tong-bu-fu-zhi-zu-fu-zhi/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Mar 2021 20:51:04 +0800</pubDate><author>code4happy@gmail.com (happy-v587)</author><guid>/mysql-yi-bu-fu-zhi-ban-tong-bu-fu-zhi-zu-fu-zhi/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;本文由原作者归档自 CSDN，原文发布于 2021-03-03。原文链接：&lt;a href="https://blog.csdn.net/LIUHUAN0520/article/details/114334101" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;mysql异步复制、半同步复制、组复制&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id="异步复制" class="headerLink"&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e5%bc%82%e6%ad%a5%e5%a4%8d%e5%88%b6" class="header-mark"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;异步复制&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;sorce不管replica的死活，写进binlog后，commit完成就算成功。如果最后一个event没有发给replica，主库就挂了，那么就会有丢失数据的风险。 &lt;img class="tw-inline" loading="lazy" src='/images/mysql-yi-bu-fu-zhi-ban-tong-bu-fu-zhi-zu-fu-zhi.md/img-01.png' alt="图 1" &gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>xtrabackup备份原理与实现</title><link>/xtrabackup-bei-fen-yuan-li-yu-shi-xian/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Feb 2021 16:31:04 +0800</pubDate><author>code4happy@gmail.com (happy-v587)</author><guid>/xtrabackup-bei-fen-yuan-li-yu-shi-xian/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
